OL,3,GNEWSAResidents fear bank closures will
OL,4,Abe bad for town
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe closure of a town's last banks
OL,7,F"doesn't bode well for the future", a
OL,8,Fresident has warned.
OL,10,FHalifax shut its branch in Huyton
OL,11,FVillage, Merseyside, last week and now
OL,12,FLloyds Bank has also closed up for the
OL,13,Flast time.
OL,15,FPatricia Mason said it was "bad" for
OL,16,Fthe likes of her 86-year-old dad, who
OL,17,Fdoes not drive and would now be forced
OL,18,Fto travel further to sort his finances.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
