OL,3,GNEWSAResidents fear bank closures will
OL,4,Abe bad for town
OL,5,
OL,6,FKnowsley Council's leader has again
OL,7,Fcalled on LINK, which works to make
OL,8,Fsure people can easily access cash
OL,9,Ffacilities, to open a banking hub in
OL,10,FHuyton Village. LINK said residents and
OL,11,Fbusinesses in the town could continue
OL,12,Fto withdraw and deposit cash at three
OL,13,FPost Offices within a mile and also use
OL,14,Fa number of free-to-use ATMs.
